# 协议、状态和审计账本统一 LF，避免不同 Git/Windows 配置改变逐行证据的字节边界。
* text=auto
.gitattributes text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.log  text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Windows 原生命令脚本保留 CRLF；压缩包、Office、CAD 与图片按二进制处理。
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.pptx binary
*.dwg  binary
*.dxf  binary
